WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
 Hey, what happened to you?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
 What the heck are you doing?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
 Oh my gosh, seriously?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
 You were attacked by a giant frog?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
 Yeah, I know, they are like 6 feet tall.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
 What did you do? Because those things do not bother people for no reason.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:42.060
 no reason. I told you you would cause a disturbance in this forest. You're so disruptive. Of course

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:54.000
 the frog is going to beat you up for you sitting over there in that spot. Over there. Yeah,

00:00:54.320 --> 00:01:00.280
 That's the frog spot. You can't just go around sitting wherever you want in this forest, okay?

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:07.180
 Listen. Can you even hear me? Hello?

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:21.780
 Hello? Oh, it looks like your eyesight is really bad right now. And you're hearing. You can't hear me very well.

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:34.540
 Okay, so, you got dunked into the mud, and now your eyes are all blurry, and your ears

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:38.480
 are filled with water and mud, so you can't hear properly.

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:43.300
 Okay, I'm going to have to fix this.

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:51.580
 I knew I'd have to babysit you when I decided to go with you into this forest.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:02:14.260
 Well, whatever. Let's get started. Listen up. I'm going to clean out your ears. Just straight up. That's all we gotta do. Your ears are full of water and mud. So I'm just going to start cleaning them out.

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:22.260
 I have a trusty earpick, and it'll do the job just fine.

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:25.360
 Okay, let's see here.

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:31.480
 Wow, it's really clogged up.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:35.140
 How deep did the frog shove you into the mud?

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:39.620
 Yeah, you're not looking so hot.

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:48.380
 Listen, you've got to be careful around these forest creatures, okay?

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:55.280
 Not that I care about you or anything, but I'd prefer not to babysit you.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:03.580
 It's pretty annoying, so please just stop doing that.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:14.940
 You have to respect the creatures of this forest, or you will get punished.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:32.400
 As you can see from today, the creatures don't really appreciate when humans come and disrespect their space.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:44.940
 This is why I always say humans are no good, they're just always causing trouble.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:04:00.140
 Yes, you're no exception, even though you seem different from the others, you're still always causing trouble.

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:04.140
 What am I gonna do with you?

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:08.140
 I guess just... keep babysitting.

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:28.140
 Okay, good.

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:43.140
 okay

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:47.140
 and the other side

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:53.140
 how's that?

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:59.140
 you're all cleared out now

00:04:59.140 --> 00:05:24.140
 Oh, a little bit more on this side here, okay, okay, good.

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:25.140
 Okay.

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.140
 How's that hearing now?

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:39.140
 Can you hear me?

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:41.140
 Hello.

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:43.140
 Good.

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:47.140
 Of course, I always do a good job with this.

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:53.140
 Try not to do this again, though, because it's very convenient for me.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:06:11.140
 I'm going to give you something for your sight. So, don't squirm around or anything. It actually tastes pretty good. But I'm going to give you this.

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:18.540
 These are magical pebbles.

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:34.840
 Yes, I have a lot of remedies in the area in case of emergencies or in case of stupid

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:45.160
 humans like you. So what you do is just take a mouthful of them and put on the blindfold

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:54.300
 and then I will do a little bit of a chant all around and your eyesight will be back.

00:06:54.300 --> 00:07:23.040
 Okay, good as new. Okay. Here. Okay. Now stay still. I have a bit of fluffy mask here. This will go over your eyes like this.

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:34.300
 Okay, now I'm going to do the chant so your eyesight will return.

00:07:54.300 --> 00:08:22.260
 There. Your eyesight's back. Good as new.

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:31.500
 Yeah. Okay. Let's see. You're actually cooperating and now I can, you know, work my magic on

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:44.860
 you. Okay. And it looks like you've got some cuts and scrapes all around. Gosh. You really

00:08:44.860 --> 00:09:03.460
 let that frog do a number on you. Okay. Okay. For this, I'm going to have to use some of

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:13.720
 my special magic living sand. Listen, this part is going to be a little bit painful, but

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:23.200
 You already know what pain feels like. You just got dunked by a frog, so I think a little bit extra won't hurt you.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:27.820
 Okay, this is the living sand.

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:35.020
 First I have to activate it.

00:09:43.720 --> 00:10:13.320
 The sand is filled with small life forms. They give you great healing when they enter your body, but they can only enter through your wounds.

00:10:13.720 --> 00:10:31.220
 So, as much as it seems to not be a good idea, this is the best idea.

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:37.760
 Listen, we have to rub the living sand into your wounds.

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:40.600
 I'm sorry, it's gotta happen.

00:10:43.000 --> 00:11:01.100
 Okay, you see. I'm just going to take a bit and put it right against your wound. So I'll put a bit on this pad.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:23.000
 It's gonna be okay. It's fine. It'll just sting a bit. It's not a big deal. Okay, well, just right here, like this.

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:37.860
 Just rubbing it in like that.

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:43.300
 Okay, okay.

00:11:43.980 --> 00:11:46.200
 I got some more for the other side here.

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:51.820
 So, I'm just going to put that right there.

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:54.540
 Okay.

00:11:56.140 --> 00:11:56.860
 Good.

00:11:58.540 --> 00:11:59.920
 And over here.

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:02.360
 Good.

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:08.820
 See, it's not that bad

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:15.440
 So the organisms are entering through your wounds

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:20.620
 And they'll be healing you very quickly

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:24.760
 So you don't have to worry now

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:30.940
 You'll notice that your pain should be gone in a few minutes

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:34.660
 Good

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:56.060
 Let's see. Okay. I'm just going to test to see if the pain is stopped. I'm going to put pressure right here. How's that? Good.

00:12:56.060 --> 00:13:00.060
 And.. right there

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:04.060
 How's that?

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:08.060
 Good. Okay.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:12.060
 And.. over here

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:16.060
 Good. Okay.

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:20.060
 And.. over here

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:24.060
 Good.

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:35.140
 Good. All right. So it's working. That's good. Have you learned your lesson, human? Okay,

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:42.920
 so what are we not going to do from now on? Sit in the frog's place. Correct. You're

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:52.860
 learning. I'm impressed. You're not as stupid as you look, I guess. Learning from your mistakes

00:13:52.860 --> 00:14:07.860
 This is probably the best way to operate in this forest, because there are a lot of strange, strange things, and sometimes we get confused.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:20.860
 Well, I don't get confused. I'm an all-knowing, powerful spirit, but creatures like you are very easily confused, so...

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:41.080
 I'm trying to be patient with you. I know that you're quite a bit lesser than me. You are an inferior species, so I'm trying to be understanding for you. But I think you're doing okay so far.

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:58.260
 Yeah. I suppose you're acceptable for a puny human. Okay. Well, you can go back to whatever

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:09.180
 you were trying to do. Try not to fall in any pits or break your limbs, because it'll

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:14.180
 It would be hard for me to get you back home, otherwise...

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:17.180
 Okay?

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:24.180
 Toodles, human, I'll see you whenever you decide to come back.
